/-!
# Universal integral quadratic forms over dyadic local fields

Umbrella import for the formalization of C. N. Beli's paper.  The imported
modules contain the preliminary lemmas, Theorem 2.1, the Jordan-coordinate
translation of Theorem 3.1, Lemmas 4.1--4.9, Corollary 4.5, and Corollary
4.10.

The two exponents printed in Theorem 3.1(3.2.1--2) differ from the result of
direct substitution into Theorem 2.1 unless the first fundamental scale order
is zero.  The direct translation is the unconditional formal endpoint; the
literal printed predicate is related by a separately stated zero-scale
comparison theorem.
-/
